    {
      "text": "[AUS] The damage prevention can only be used if the block is successful, and only in the resulting (block-induced) combat. [LSJ 20010813]",
      "group": "",
      "reminder": false,
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "[LSJ 20010813]",
